    "CommitMsg": "Gate-2.2 C16-R3.4 (B/C/D): source-anchored evidence reconstruction\n\nWIP checkpoint: source-owned verification contract, deterministic C16 derivation\nshared by generator and verifier, and the rewritten source-anchored verifier.\nControls follow.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e",
